Jaskar, who calls himself the poorly worded usurper, is a genie in the film made by the [[Org/Bisney and Dixar/Arcane Intelligence|arcane intelligence]]. From the waist up he is a lion in fine clothes; from the waist down he is smoke. He was brother to the sultan of Pride Rock until a street-rat prince and a genie overthrew him, and he wished himself into a genie, bound to a lamp. He kept the [[Phenomena/Enchanted Mirror|enchanted mirror]] in the [[Geography/Elephant Graveyard of Wonders|Elephant Graveyard of Wonders]] and grants wishes to whoever rubs the lamp; the three villains took the mirror from him and escaped through it.
